      "name": "Heat Beam",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "fire",
        "occult"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The immolis targets a living creature within 30 feet and directs a beam of volatile psychic energy toward it, increasing the rate at which the creature's body produces heat. The target must attempt a DC 20 Fortitude Saving Throw save. The second and third time an immolis uses Heat Beam in the same round, the DC lowers to DC 16 Fortitude Saving Throw or DC 12 Fortitude Saving Throw, respectively.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes (2d6+5) Fire Damage damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes (4d6+5) Fire Damage]{4d6+5 fire damage and 5 persistent fire damage}.</p>",
